  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組需要「精煉儲物」</span></span></strong></span></a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">如果您想將此模組加入您的模組整合包，歡迎自由使用 :)</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">此模組僅新增通用網格</span><span style=\"color:#000\">。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1112/839/recipe.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>可切換為：</p>\n<p>1.21.1 或更高版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>網格</li>\n<li>合成網格</li>\n<li>自動合成監控器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1.20.1 或更低版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>網格</li>\n<li>合成網格</li>\n<li>流體網格</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" width=\"381\" height=\"144\"></a></p>",
